[[48,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/939003947.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[64,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Loosen the bands (1a) and remove the vacuum air circuit resonator (1b) after having released it from the bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/939003521.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[64,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Refit the vacuum aira circuit resonator, secure to the bracket and tighten the bands.</p>"],[6,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Loosen the band and remove the resonator from the connector on the air hose.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/946001150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Place the resonator back in its housing and fasten it to the connector on the air housing using the band.</p>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Loosen the band (1a) securing the hose (1b) to the air hose between the flow meter and the throttle body.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts and remove the resonator assembly.</p><p>- If necessary, loosen the band and separate the resonator from the hose.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/946001151.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Connect the hose to the resonator and secure it using the band.</p><p>- Fit the resonator assembly in place and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>- Tighten the band securing the hose to the air hose between the flow meter and the throttle body.</p>"]]